  <item>
    <title>V神传奇：以太坊的诞生与web3的未来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d91f38ee04007d8843992f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d91f38ee04007d8843992f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2024 03:02:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>【主播】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Catherine Lyu，前就职于新加坡美元对冲基金，现在是全球高水平教育家协会创始人、web3 training创始人。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>【你将听到】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>今天又来讲另一个俄罗斯的天才。一个可以跟 linux 之父，脸书 CEO 小扎肩并肩的技术天才。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>他4岁开始接触编程，12岁就用C++语言编写游戏，19岁辍学创业。俄罗斯「天才少年」缔造了这样的神话。他就是大名鼎鼎的Eth以太坊创始人，Vitalik Buterin，人送绰号-V神，连俄罗斯总统普京都是他的粉丝！</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> - V神的成长背景</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> - V神早期的技术成就和对数学的兴趣（创建了第一个复杂文档“兔子百科全书”</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> - V神的教育经历</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a>- V神的语言天赋和语言学习能力</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> - V神在滑铁卢大学的学习经历</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> - V神如何开始接触比特币和区块链技术</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> - 以太坊的构想（V神创立以太坊的初衷和愿景）</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_xwaqJ0NWeCBArJOI6gN-iWBq4.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> - 以太坊的早期发展（V神如何开始募集开发者和以太坊的早期发展）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> - V神辍学创业并全身心投入以太坊的创建</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv0AFPcSf9gOb3pKvO53yupLcvUG.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> - V神如何通过比特币赚取第一桶金</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> - V神以太坊的全球旅行，寻找改进比特币的方法</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> - 发布以太坊白皮书和募集开发者</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> - 以太坊的技术创新（如智能合约和EVM）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> - 成立以太坊基金会</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> - 以太坊的ICO之路</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a> - 2016年以太坊的分叉事件</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> - 以太坊的市值增长和市场表现</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> - 智能合约的安全问题</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> - 以太坊的未来展望</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>📕书单： 《数学之书》 克里福·皮寇弗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>🌟欢迎大家关注【Web3 Training】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Web3 Training是一家致力于实现企业和候选人双赢的求职培训公司，专注于金融科技领域的中高端人才招聘、培训、咨询等全方位服务于一体。 秉承“致力于做你职业路上的导师 ”的理念。对内，打造一流实践课程；对外，提供行业高品质服务企业。我们的slogan 社区共成长。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>【在这里找到我们】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>小助手lvy: 微信 17816198874</span></blockquote>]]></description>
