    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cda8e2f78678cbe7788301</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cda8e2f78678cbe7788301</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Aug 2024 10:22:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>【主播】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Catherine Lyu，前就职于新加坡美元对冲基金，现在是全球高水平教育家协会创始人、web3 training创始人。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>【你将听到】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>谁能想到，就在我们发布上期播客后几天后也就是在周末，没想到先是了解到依据美国监狱局的信息，CZ 预计将于9月29日获得释放。随后，就收到这样的新闻：法国媒体 TF1 电视台报道，通讯应用 Telegram 的创始人兼 CEO Pavel Durov 于当地时间周六晚间在巴黎布尔歇机场被捕。&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>今天我们继续分享【Pavel Durov 被捕对市场的影响】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a>- Telegram创始人杜罗夫被捕事件概述</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a>- Telegram官方声明与投资者反应</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a>- 杜罗夫背景与Telegram用户增长</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a>- 杜罗夫的国籍问题与逮捕原因</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> - 杜罗夫的国际法律地位</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="403">06:43</a> - 互联网自由危机与政府监管</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> - 法国逮捕杜罗夫的可能动机</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> - 美国SEC对TON的制裁背景</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> - 国际社会对杜罗夫被捕的反应</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a>- 马斯克及其他人士的支持</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a>- TON社区对杜罗夫被捕的回应</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FupjIJ2ThymYoTJOfm51fFuW9IOs.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> - TON项目介绍与发展历程</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a>- 数字抵抗运动与REDO NFT的象征意义</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrFDeqg8azUjTw1ZLAU9RkujEOkk.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> - REDO形象的历史与意义</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> - REDO代币的市场表现</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a>- TON未来的市场走向分析</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1273">21:13</a> - 对言论自由与网络自由的思考</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>🌟欢迎大家关注【Web3 Training】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Web3 Training是一家致力于实现企业和候选人双赢的求职培训公司，专注于金融科技领域的中高端人才招聘、培训、咨询等全方位服务于一体。 秉承“致力于做你职业路上的导师 ”的理念。对内，打造一流实践课程；对外，提供行业高品质服务企业。我们的slogan 社区共成长。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>【在这里找到我们】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>小助手lvy: 微信 17816198874</span></blockquote>]]></description>
