  <item>
    <title>TON的幕后推手,Telegram的创始人Pavel Durov的故事（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c6f186ead5fc3792a81420</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c6f186ead5fc3792a81420</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Aug 2024 08:06:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>【主播】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Catherine Lyu，前就职于新加坡美元对冲基金，现在是全球高水平教育家协会创始人、web3 training创始人。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>【你将听到】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>TON的幕后推手,Telegram的创始人Pavel Durov的故事（上）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> Telegram的创立背景 - 杜罗夫与政府的冲突，Telegram的加密和自由精神。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsba7ZjfJMrqZG0gVVRGwLqEtPxX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（telegram 的logo）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FimzvmKrmeJdfZHC0RMGX7eyIdym.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（维尔·杜罗夫-照片）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a>Telegram的加密特性和Web 3应用的结合</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 杜罗夫的早年生活 - 出生于圣彼得堡，意大利都灵度过童年，对编程的兴趣。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> VK的创立与成功 - 杜罗夫与哥哥尼古莱创立VK，成为俄罗斯流行的社交网站</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> &nbsp;杜罗夫的政治理念 - 自由主义者，VK上的自由言论政策</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a> &nbsp;VK的政治压力 - 2011年俄罗斯国家杜马选举，VK成为抗议平台</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 杜罗夫对抗政府 -不执行政府删除账号命令，用萌宠图片表达抗议</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> VK的政府干预 - 杜罗夫失去VK控制权，公司被政府接近的公司控制</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> &nbsp;Telegram的设计理念 &nbsp;- 加密协议，隐私和安全，由数学家主导的项目</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> &nbsp;Telegram的资金来源 &nbsp;- &nbsp;杜罗夫的资金支持，ICO和债券发行</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> &nbsp;TON与ICO - Telegram的区块链尝试，SEC的介入</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> &nbsp;TON的重启 &nbsp;- TON更名为TON，发行加密钱包</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a> &nbsp;Telegram的Web 3市场 - 用户名交易，数字财产的商业化</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;杜罗夫的使命与价值观 - 37岁生日感言，人生中被低估的事物</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhFPc07N0-ll5WAMAcALxP6wWcFn.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> &nbsp;结语 关于telegram的故事 未完待续～</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>🌟欢迎大家关注【Web3 Training】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Web3 Training是一家致力于实现企业和候选人双赢的求职培训公司，专注于金融科技领域的中高端人才招聘、培训、咨询等全方位服务于一体。 秉承“致力于做你职业路上的导师 ”的理念。对内，打造一流实践课程；对外，提供行业高品质服务企业。我们的slogan 社区共成长。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>【在这里找到我们】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>小助手lvy: 微信 17816198874</span></blockquote>]]></description>
