  <item>
    <title>Web3风潮下的人才猎场：百万猎头视角</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c4ad29db5e6d6bf9b9b4aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c4ad29db5e6d6bf9b9b4aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Aug 2024 14:50:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Catherine Lyu，前就职于新加坡美元对冲基金，现在是全球高水平教育家协会创始人、web3 training创始人。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>万万 &nbsp;web3、量化猎头 百万猎头</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>【你将听到】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Web3行业猎头万万的从业经历、行业见解以及对Web3行业和量化金融行业的比较</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>万万的从业经历之如何入行web3</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>分享如何0-1学习量化金融和We3行业知识&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>web3对于英文能力的要求</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>量化金融与WEB3行业的比较</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>分享量化金融和Web3行业的用人需求变化</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a>&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>量化和web3行业的薪资水平对比</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>web3行业的合同与福利问题</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquot